From: LinearMC <linearmc@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] LinearMC: ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/io/datacontroller/EntityDataController.java

Ported from the Folia feature stack (minecraft-0009-Linear-region-format.patch, minecraft-0014-Linear-default-format.patch).
Hunks kept in stack-apply order. Reconcile against Canvas base
patches touching this file before staging (see PORT-PLAN.md).
---
diff --git a/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/io/datacontroller/EntityDataController.java b/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/io/datacontroller/EntityDataController.java
--- a/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/io/datacontroller/EntityDataController.java
+++ b/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/io/datacontroller/EntityDataController.java
@@ -61,7 +61,23 @@ public final class EntityDataController extends MoonriseRegionFileIO.RegionDataC
 
         public EntityRegionFileStorage(final RegionStorageInfo regionStorageInfo, final Path directory,
                                        final boolean dsync) {
-            super(regionStorageInfo, directory, dsync);
+            this(regionStorageInfo, directory, dsync, net.linear.RegionFileFormat.LINEAR, 6); // Linear - default preserves the configured default (LINEAR, 6)
+        }
+
+        // Linear - format-aware entry point. The outer EntityDataController
+        // constructor is unchanged (it receives the already-built storage); ServerLevel
+        // threads the world format + linear compression through this overload.
+        // Linear - 6-arg overload adds the crash flag; 5-arg delegates with default true.
+        public EntityRegionFileStorage(final RegionStorageInfo regionStorageInfo, final Path directory,
+                                       final boolean dsync, final net.linear.RegionFileFormat format,
+                                       final int linearCompression) {
+            this(regionStorageInfo, directory, dsync, format, linearCompression, true);
+        }
+
+        public EntityRegionFileStorage(final RegionStorageInfo regionStorageInfo, final Path directory,
+                                       final boolean dsync, final net.linear.RegionFileFormat format,
+                                       final int linearCompression, final boolean linearCrashOnBrokenSymlink) {
+            super(regionStorageInfo, directory, dsync, format, linearCompression, linearCrashOnBrokenSymlink);
         }
 
         @Override
